Purpose: Analyze query execution plans and identify performance bottlenecks.

Neo4j Profiling Commands

PROFILE
MATCH (c:Customer {customerId:'C001'})
RETURN c

or

EXPLAIN
MATCH (c:Customer {customerId:'C001'})
RETURN c

What Profiling Helps Identify

Node Scans
Index Seeks
Relationship Traversals
Query Cost
Memory Usage

Expected Optimization Goal

❌ Before Optimization

NodeByLabelScan

✅ After Optimization

