Benefits

Validates index usage
Detects inefficient queries
Improves performance at scale
Supports production readiness
Key Takeaway

Indexing accelerates node discovery, while Profiling validates query efficiency. Together, they are the primary strategies for ensuring Neo4j performance as the graph scales from 1K to 100K+ nodes.
